usage: execute_release.py [-h] --package PACKAGE --operation-id OPERATION_ID
                          [--review REVIEW] [--execute]
                          {preflight,runtime,upload,assemble,hk-install,cdn-install,cdn-check,hk-switch,publish,inspect,audit}

Explicit, reviewed, one-phase-at-a-time publication. Default is local plan
only. This file is preparation code. No remote action runs at import or
without --execute and a review bound to the exact package and operation
identifier.

positional arguments:
  {preflight,runtime,upload,assemble,hk-install,cdn-install,cdn-check,hk-switch,publish,inspect,audit}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --package PACKAGE
  --operation-id OPERATION_ID
  --review REVIEW
